                "detail": "A crack in a headland is widened by hydraulic action -> erosion enlarges the crack into a cave -> continued erosion breaks through the headland forming an arch -> wave action and weathering undermine the arch roof until it collapses leaving a stack -> further erosion of the stack's base leaves a stump."
